  "notes": "CONJUGATION (godan-su):\n- Negative: {目指|めざ}さない\n- Te-form: {目指|めざ}して\n- Past: {目指|めざ}した\n- Potential: {目指|めざ}せる\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive. Takes を for the goal or destination.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{目指|めざ}している indicates an ongoing state of working toward a goal.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {優勝|ゆうしょう}を{目指|めざ}す: to aim for the championship\n- {頂上|ちょうじょう}を{目指|めざ}す: to head for the top\n- プロを{目指|めざ}す: to aspire to go professional\n- {合格|ごうかく}を{目指|めざ}す: to aim to pass (an exam)",
